<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ITZ FIZZ | Scroll Hero</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: #080808;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 35px 8%;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, #222 0%, #101010 45%, #080808 80%);
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .logo span,
    h1 span {
      color: #c6ff00;
    }

    .menu {
      border: 1px solid #555;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      color: #ddd;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .content {
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 70px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .small-text {
      color: #c6ff00;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(60px, 12vw, 150px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -5px;
    }

    .description {
      color: #aaa;
      margin: 25px auto 35px;
      max-width: 450px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px 16px;
      min-height: 125px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      border-color: #c6ff00;
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      background: rgba(198, 255, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .card .number {
      color: #c6ff00;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #999;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .car-area {
      position: relative;
      height: 180px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .glow {
      position: absolute;
      width: 65%;
      height: 45px;
      background: #c6ff00;
      filter: blur(70px);
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    .car {
      position: relative;
      font-size: clamp(90px, 17vw, 160px);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 20px rgba(198, 255, 0, 0.15));
      animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .scroll-text {
      color: #777;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .second-section {
      min-height: 70vh;
      padding: 100px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(#080808, #151515);
    }

    .second-section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(35px, 7vw, 75px);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .second-section h2 span {
      color: #c6ff00;
    }

    .second-section p {
      color: #aaa;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      background: #c6ff00;
      color: #080808;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: white;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #080808;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      50% {
        transform: translateY(-12px);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 25px 5%;
      }

      .content {
        padding-top: 65px;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -3px;
      }

      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .card {
        padding: 17px 12px;
      }

      .car-area {
        height: 140px;
      }

      .description {
        font-size: 13px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 350px) {
      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <section class="hero" id="hero">

    <header>
      <div class="logo">ITZ <span>FIZZ</span></div>
      <div class="menu">SCROLL EXPERIENCE</div>
    </header>

    <main class="content">
      <p class="small-text">WELCOME TO THE FUTURE</p>

      <h1>ITZ <span>FIZZ</span></h1>

      <p class="description">
        Experience a bold digital world where creative design,
        smooth animation and modern technology come together.
      </p>

      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">01 / DESIGN</div>
          <h3>Creative Design</h3>
          <p>Bold visuals with a modern futuristic style.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">02 / MOTION</div>
          <h3>Smooth Animation</h3>
          <p>Fluid movement for a better browsing experience.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">03 / EXPERIENCE</div>
          <h3>Modern Experience</h3>
          <p>A clean layout designed to stand out.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">04 / DEVICE</div>
          <h3>Responsive Layout</h3>
          <p>Designed for both mobile and desktop screens.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="car-area">
        <div class="glow"></div>
        <div class="car" aria-label="Sports car">🏎️</div>
      </div>

      <p class="scroll-text">↓ SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</p>
    </main>
  </section>

  <section class="second-section">
    <h2>FEEL THE <span>SPEED</span></h2>
    <p>
      Innovation meets imagination. Explore a digital experience
      built with creativity, motion and modern web technology.
    </p>

    <a class="button" href="#hero">BACK TO TOP ↑</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    ITZ FIZZ · CREATIVE WEB EXPERIENCE
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
